    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Veteran Owned, Hand Made</h2>
      <p>This shop is veteran-owned, and that shows up in how we work: attention to detail, respect for the material, and no shortcuts. Every flag, heart, and keepsake that leaves this shop passes through the same hands that cut, sanded, stained, and finished it.</p>

      <h2>Craftsmanship Philosophy</h2>
      <p>We work in real wood, not veneer — which means grain, knots, and a little natural variation in every board. We don't hide that; we build around it. It's why every product here is one of one. Two pieces might share a pattern, but the wood underneath never behaves quite the same way twice.</p>

      <h2>Where We Are Now</h2>
      <p>The shop isn't actively taking orders at the moment, but this site stays up as a home for our work and a way for people to reach out. If you're interested in a piece or want to know when we're back to making and shipping, head over to the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
